"type":"Story","byline":"Matt Bowen","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Brandon Aiyuk joining Commanders, will reunite with college QB Jayden Daniels","description":"Wide receiver Brandon Aiyuk is signing with the Commanders on their practice squad, agent Drew Rosenhaus told ESPN's Adam Schefter","published":"2026-11-25T18:32:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50595281/brandon-aiyuk-finishes-visit-commanders","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"John Keim","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"NFL survivor power rankings: Why this is the week to use the Jaguars or Texans","description":"ESPN NFL survivor pool strategy, predictions and ranking the top seven options for Week 12.","published":"2026-11-25T18:23:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/fantasy/football/story/_/id/50594339/nfl-survivor-week-12-survivor-pool-strategy-advice-picks","type":"Story","byline":"Mackenzie Kraemer","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Falcons 'aware' of insinuations Pearce still trying to contact ex Jackson","description":"Kevin Stefanski said he and the team are aware of assertions made by Rickea Jackson that insinuated James Pearce Jr. is still trying to contact her.","published":"2026-11-25T18:13:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50595254/falcons-aware-insinuations-pearce-trying-call-ex-gf","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Marc Raimondi","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chiefs rule RB Kenneth Walker III (groin) out for showdown vs. Bills","description":"Chiefs running back Kenneth Walker III (groin) has been ruled out for Thursday's showdown against the Bills, the team announced Wednesday","published":"2026-11-25T17:22:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50594656/chiefs-rb-kenneth-walker-iii-groin-thursday-vs-bills","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Nate Taylor","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Fantasy buzz: How to navigate your roster for the Thanksgiving slate","description":"How do you decide which players go where for six days of fantasy football? Tristan H. Cockcroft breaks it all down.","published":"2026-11-25T16:00:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/fantasy/football/story/_/id/40699880/fantasy-football-injuries-position-battles-nfl-news-analysis","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Fantasy","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Fantasy football flex and superflex rankings for Week 12","description":"Trying to decide between a couple of closely ranked players this week? Eric Karabell's ranks are here to help.","published":"2026-11-25T15:55:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/fantasy/football/story/_/id/50573832/fantasy-football-superflex-rankings-2026-qb-rb-wr-te","type":"Story","byline":"Eric Karabell","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Fantasy football rankings Week 12: PPR and superflex","description":"Weekly composite ranks for each position in PPR and IDP formats, as well as Eric Karabell's superflex ranks.","published":"2026-11-25T15:53:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/fantasy/football/story/_/page/FFWeeklyPlayerRank26main-49797082/fantasy-football-rankings-2026-qb-rb-wr-te-dst","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Fantasy","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Fantasy football rankings for Week 12: Wide receiver","description":"Fantasy football rankings from Matt Bowen, Mike Clay, Tristan H. Cockcroft, Daniel Dopp, Eric Karabell, Liz Loza, Eric Moody and Field Yates.","published":"2026-11-25T15:52:29.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/fantasy/football/story/_/page/FFWeeklyPlayerRank26-50573508/nfl-fantasy-football-rankings-2026-wr-wide-receiver","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Fantasy","source":"ESPN"}],"wiki":{"title":"Tay Martin","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tay_Martin","description":"American football player (born 1997)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:17Z","intro":"Davontavean Martin (born December 14, 1997) is an American professional football wide receiver for the Detroit Lions of the National Football League (NFL). He played college football for the Washington State Cougars and Oklahoma State Cowboys. Martin has also been a member of the San Francisco 49ers, Tennessee Titans, Washington Commanders, and the UFL's Columbus Aviators. He was signed as an undrafted free agent by the 49ers following the 2022 NFL draft.","sections":[{"key":"career","title":"Professional career","text":"SAN FRANCISCO 49ERS\nOn April 30, 2022, Martin signed with the San Francisco 49ers as an undrafted free agent. He was released during final roster cutdowns on August 30. Martin was signed to the team's practice squad the following day. He signed a reserve/future contract with the 49ers on January 31, 2023.\nOn August 29, 2023, Martin was waived by the 49ers and re-signed to the practice squad. He signed a reserve/future contract with San Francisco on February 13, 2024.\nMartin was waived by the 49ers on August 27, 2024, and re-signed to the practice squad. On September 3, Martin was released from the practice squad.\n\nTENNESSEE TITANS\nOn September 10, 2024, Martin was signed to the Tennessee Titans' practice squad. He was promoted to the active roster on January 4, 2025. In a 23-14 Week 18 loss to the Houston Texans, Martin made his first career reception on a 49-yard touchdown pass from quarterback Will Levis.\nOn May 7, 2025, Martin was waived/injured by the Titans and reverted to the injured reserve the following day. He was waived again on May 14.\n\nWASHINGTON COMMANDERS\nMartin signed with the Washington Commanders on July 23, 2025, and was released on August 26. Martin re-signed with their practice squad on September 16. He was elevated to the active roster for Weeks 4, 5, and 6, but was released from the practice squad on October 17.\n\nCOLUMBUS AVIATORS\nOn January 14, 2026, Martin was selected by the Columbus Aviators of the United Football League (UFL).\n\nDETROIT LIONS\nOn June 16, 2026, Martin signed with the Detroit Lions. For his contributions to special teams in the Week 1 win against the Saints, he received a game ball."},{"key":"personal","title":"Personal life","text":"Tay Martin is engaged to Morgan Pitre. They have two daughters, Reign and Valley."}],"wikidataId":"Q114282822","social":{}},"transactions":[{"date":"2026-07-22","text":"Waived WR Kyre Duplessis. Signed WRs Tarik Black, Lucky Jackson and Tay Martin to contracts. Placed WR Kendrick Law on injured reserve."},{"date":"2026-06-16","text":"Signed WRs Tay Martin, Tarik Black and Lucky Jackson to contracts. Placed WR Kendrick Law on injured reserve. Waived WR Kyre Duplessis."}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4245144","pfr":"https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/M/MartTa00.htm","pff":"https://www.pff.com/nfl/players/tay-martin/61811","otc":"https://overthecap.com/player/tay-martin/10555","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tay_Martin"},"insights":["2026 cap number of $1.0M is the 44th-largest on the roster.","Contract expires after this season.","Entered the league in 2022 as an undrafted free agent."]}